# CSS 7 Configuration
#
# This file is a placeholder for future custom configuration needs.
#
# By default, CSS 7 is started with:
#   - Port: 3000 (via -p flag)
#   - Root folder: /data (via -f flag for filesystem-based storage)
#   - Base URL: http://localhost:3000
#
# To customize CSS 7 further, pass additional configuration via:
#   1. Command-line arguments (see docker-compose.yml)
#   2. A JSON-LD configuration file (use -c flag with path to config)
#
# Reference: https://github.com/CommunitySolidServer/CommunitySolidServer
